For a plain solitaire at 1.5ct, the [radiant cut solitaire guide](/radiant-cut-solitaire-engagement-ring) covers prong types and basket heights in detail. For a full breakdown of all setting styles, the [radiant cut diamond settings guide](/radiant-cut-diamond-settings) covers every option with metal comparisons.

